# landmark (assets/world3d/crag/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Candlewick Crag: a ridge of snow-capped peaks along the back, the two north outcrops raised into spires, the beacon burning on the east one.
# the west outcrop's spires, each with its cap of snow
